00:24:23.700 --> 00:24:26.039
study and guess what if you&#x27;re a big

00:24:26.039 --> 00:24:28.500
pharmaceutical company then you&#x27;re gonna

00:24:28.500 --> 00:24:30.360
put basically you&#x27;re gonna make

